  "body": "\ud83d\udfe1 **Update the fork-boundary test for the slot-1 poll**\n\nThis now wakes one slot later, but `identity.test.ts` still defines `epochPollMs` for epoch slot 0 and advances only that far in `resolves once the Gloas fork is reached`. It then awaits the pending promise without advancing fake time again. I reproduced the 20-second test timeout at this head.\n\nPlease include `+ 1` in the test's poll deadline, move its mocked slot to `SLOTS_PER_EPOCH + 1`, and assert that no request occurs at slot 0.",
